of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-05b77d61-14e6-4dfb-bb02-a1710e35be0d","nfa-50854eee-b613-46d7-9ce5-698bc4011c04","sdu-b587f308-0323-4abf-bc08-3d2b3fb6a4ae"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","NFA National Research Centre for the Working Environment","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"An Occupational Health Literacy Intervention in Nursing Homes Improved Organizational Health Literacy—A Quasi-Experimental Stepped Wedge Cluster Trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-097.71-768610","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Confocal microscopy-based pH ratiometry has identified steep pH gradients in simplified models of dental biofilm, as well as highly acidic microenvironments associated with caries progression. Saliva flow has an important impact on biofilm pH, but is typically not included in laboratory setups. The aim of the present study was to investigate the impact of saliva flow on microscale pH developments in complex, in situ-grown dental biofilms (n=54; 48 h and 96-h) from healthy participants (n=9). To mimic the oral conditions as closely as possible, a microfluidic flow-cell was employed that provided saliva flow with film thicknesses matching those in the oral cavity. Biofilm acidogenicity was correlated to microbial composition, as determined by 16S rRNA sequencing. Data were analysed using Wilcoxon signed rank tests and Pearson/Spearman correlatons. pH drops in the biofilms upon exposure to sucrose were moderate, and more pronounced in 96-h than in 48-h biofilms (p=0.012). Biofilm pH was raised by stimulated (8 mm/min and 30 mm/min), but not unstimulated saliva flow (0.8 mm/min). Both veryical and horizontal pH gradients were observed, with lower pH at the biofilm base, and an accumulation of acids downstream. pH was negatively correlated to biofilm thickness (48-h: p≤0.0001; 96-h: p=0.002) and positively correlated to the thickness of the saliva film (48-h: p=0.0008; 96-h: p=0.0002). In biofilms with low pH, neither the species richness nor the abundance of acidogenic genera were increased. However, several genera commonly associated with biofilm maturity were more abundant. This work was supported by the Danish Dental Association (053).","author_count":5,"contributors":["Kristensen, Mathilde Frost","Lund, Marie Braad","Schramm, Andreas","Lau, Ellen Frandsen","Schlafer, Sebastian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-687862"],"event":{"end":"2023-09-10","place":"Egmond aan Zee, nl","start":"2023-07-05","title":"70th ORCA Congress","year":"2023"},"filters":{"added":"2023-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ratiometric monitoring of extracellular ph at the microscale in in situ grown dental biofilms exposed to different saliva flow velocities and film thicknesses","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-687862","ids":["au-74192fd3-20e1-4531-aae0-f51c93fa15c0"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-ADAAD8648F5E59B03414D43FF8F298B3"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Dentistry and Oral Health, Department of Dentistry and Oral Health - Section for Oral Ecology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mathilde Frost","key":"kristensenpau","last":"Kristensen","locid":"3db74fb4-c382-451d-bd24-abea0bc2092c","name":"Kristensen, Mathilde Frost","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Marie Braad","key":"lundpau","last":"Lund","locid":"ccca6a51-5b47-45b6-969c-b0c5ea95100c","name":"Lund, Marie Braad","orcid":"0000-0003-1543-1009","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Andreas","key":"schrammpau","last":"Schramm","locid":"25080de3-b60e-46b4-a606-d99f1ec089e5","name":"Schramm, Andreas","orcid":"0000-0002-7614-9616","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Ellen Frandsen","key":"laupau","last":"Lau","locid":"7f9eea58-bc93-4713-9ed2-69e1b88adab2","name":"La