{"abstract":"Dokumentet beskriver de kompetencer, som vurderes nødvendige for, at musikterapeuter kan yde borgere, patienter og deres pårørende palliativ musikterapi af højeste, faglige kvalitet og bidrage til optimering af den tværfaglige, palliative indsats i Danmark","author_count":6,"contributors":["Lindstrøm, Signe Marie","Falk, Marie","Laurberg Knudsen, Bente","Ørnholt Bøtker, Julie","Lau Hyldgaard, Ulla","Rasmussen, Leif"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-091785"],"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Kompetenceudvikling","Musikterapi","Palliation"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Sct. Maria Hospice"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"anbefalinger til kompetencer for musikterapeuter i den palliative indsats","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.dmcgpal.dk/files/januar2020_musikterapeuter_a4brochure_low.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["Med støtte fra Dansk Musikterapeutforening (DMTF) til layout og tryk."],"id":"S01-000.00-091785","ids":["aau-8fa0022f-def0-4bcf-8326-b93e1936c33c"],"keyword":["Kompetenceudvikling","Musikterapi","Palliation","kompetenceregistrering"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-46349662B71B3585935BFE58D8CAE6E9"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg Universi